title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Which verdict and why
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: The verdict is worked out from the patient's row, top question first. A check that could not run is 'Not checked'. Any failed or unconfirmed question gives 'Fix before billing'. If all pass, a missing or unknown authorization gives 'Authorization first'. Otherwise 'Cleared to bill'. The band shows the verdict and the one fact that decides it, as a label and a value. There is no headline and no reason sentence: the rows under the band carry the detail.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the first five failures have a seeded patient on the list (R-1101, R-0975, R-1118, I-2275, R-0921) and every one has a chip under 'Try a sample' or 'More samples' on Verify.
---
start s1 "A result opens for a patient"
decision qu "Did the check run? (Verify not paused)"
decision q1 "Coverage active on the service date,\nunder the member ID given?"
decision q2 "Service covered and confirmed by the plan?"
decision q3 "Clinic enrolled and in network, and confirmed?"
decision q4 "Every day or unit limit still has room?"
decision q5 "Another plan pays first?"
decision q6 "Authorization needed but not approved,\nor no rule on file?\n(required, in progress, under review, retro request open, unknown)"

group gFix "Fix before billing (red): the fact is the first check that fails"
  screen f0 "Verdict 'Fix before billing'"
  process f1 "Coverage 'Lapsed 10/12'\nor 'Ended 09/30', and 'Ended 09/30, now with Cardinal' when the member moved"
  process f2 "Coverage 'Not found'\nNothing else is checked and no payment line is shown"
  process f8 "Member ID 'Plan has ID ending 5521'"
  process f4 "Benefits 'Not covered'"
  process f9 "Benefits 'Not confirmed'"
  process f3 "Enrollment 'Not enrolled' or 'Not confirmed'"
  process f7 "Limit '14 of 14 days used' (or units, for IOP)"
  process f6 "Other insurance 'Another plan pays first'"
endgroup

group gAuth "Authorization first (amber)"
  screen a0 "Verdict 'Authorization first'"
  toast a1 "Authorization 'In progress', 'Payer reviewing', 'Required, not on file' or 'Retro request open'\nPrimary button 'Start authorization'"
  toast a2 "No rule on file: Authorization 'Requirement unknown'"
endgroup

group gOk "Cleared to bill (green)"
  screen o0 "Verdict 'Cleared to bill'"
  toast o1 "Authorization 'On file, 11 days left' or 'Not required'"
endgroup

group gUn "Not checked (grey)"
  screen u0 "Verdict 'Not checked'"
  toast u1 "Coverage 'Not checked'\nNothing was asked of the plan. 'Open Settings' and 'Re-check' are the buttons"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The exceptions"

s1 --> qu
qu -->|No| u0 --> u1 --> g1
qu -->|Yes| q1
q1 -->|No: lapsed, ended| f1 --> f0
q1 -->|No: not found| f2 --> f0
q1 -->|No: another member ID| f8 --> f0
q1 -->|Yes| q2
q2 -->|No: not covered| f4 --> f0
q2 -->|No: not confirmed| f9 --> f0
q2 -->|Yes| q3
q3 -->|No| f3 --> f0
q3 -->|Yes| q4
q4 -->|No| f7 --> f0
q4 -->|Yes| q5
q5 -->|Yes| f6 --> f0
q5 -->|No| q6
q6 -->|Yes| a0 --> a1 --> g1
a0 -.-> a2
q6 -->|No| o0 --> o1 --> g1
f0 --> g1
f0 -.-> g2
